talking about. Okay?

308
00:26:41,666 --> 00:26:43,224
Hey! Everybody!
It's Rice Bowl!

309
00:26:43,335 --> 00:26:46,896
Come on, don't you wanna grab a beer
with an old buddy from high school?

310
00:26:47,005 --> 00:26:49,667
- I'm not this David-
- <i>[Millie] David?</i>

311
00:26:52,477 --> 00:26:54,377
Yo, it's the Rice Cake.

312
00:26:54,479 --> 00:26:57,039
- [Chuckles]
- <i>[Crowd Cheering]</i>

313
00:26:57,148 --> 00:26:59,776
- Millie?
- Hi!

314
00:26:59,884 --> 00:27:02,148
You were gonna leave
without saying anything?

315
00:27:02,253 --> 00:27:04,153
Uh-
[Chuckles]

316
00:27:04,255 --> 00:27:06,849
- Sorry. I didn't see you.
- No?

317
00:27:06,958 --> 00:27:10,086
