321
00:27:20,305 --> 00:27:24,105
Yeah, that was really cool. Why don't you
go find a bench and sleep it off. Okay?

322
00:27:24,209 --> 00:27:27,940
<i>Why don't you go make me</i>
<i>a drink, sweetheart? Huh?</i>

323
00:27:28,046 --> 00:27:29,707
A little splash of that.
[Laughs]

324
00:27:29,814 --> 00:27:32,180
- [Grunts]
- Hey! No!

325
00:27:32,283 --> 00:27:34,945
- <i>[Crowd Shouting]</i>
- <i>[Man Shouting] Fight! Come on! Fight!</i>

326
00:27:35,053 --> 00:27:37,419
- Come on.
- [Grunting Continues]

327
00:27:38,456 --> 00:27:40,890
- Mark!
- <i>Come on, man!</i>

328
00:27:40,992 --> 00:27:42,960
- <i>[Millie] Stop it, you guys!</i>
- <i>Yeah!</i>

329
00:27:43,061 --> 00:27:46,428
Rice Bowl goes down!
Whoo!

330
00:27:46,531 --> 00:27:48,897
[Grunting, Shouting]

331
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:51,969
[Coughing, Panting]

332
00:27:53,405 --> 00:27:55,635
- Whoo!
- [Groans]

333
00:27:57,976 --> 00:28:01,434
[Groaning, Panting]
Wh-What did you do to me?

334
00:28:01,546 --> 00:28:03,514
Freak!

335
00:28:04,549 --> 00:28:06,517
[Chuckles]

336
00:28:08,553 --> 00:28:11,147
Guess I don't know my own strength.

337
00:28:11,256 --> 00:28:13,281
- [Gasps]
- [Chuckles]

338
00:28:18,663 --> 00:28:20,756
Hey, wh-

339
00:28:22,901 --> 00:28:25,665
- [Gasps] Hey. Are you okay?
- Hey.

340
00:28:25,770 --> 00:28:27,670
Yeah.

341
00:28:27,772 --> 00:28:30,263
Where's Mark?

342
00:28:30,375 --> 00:28:32,605
- He took off.
- What?

343
00:28:32,711 --> 00:28:36,147
Yeah, I don't think, uh, he's gonna
come back anytime soon.

344
00:28:36,247 --> 00:28:38,511
Oh.

345
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:44,980
Bleeding a little.

346
00:28:45,090 --> 00:28:47,490
We should take care of that.

347
00:28:47,592 --> 00:28:49,560
Come on.

348
00:28:50,795 --> 00:28:53,696
<i>[Customers Cheering,</i>
<i>Applauding]</i>

349
00:28:55,800 --> 00:28:57,768
<i>##[Ballad]</i>

350
00:29:02,807 --> 00:29:06,709
So, you saw me as soon as I came in?

351
00:29:06,811 --> 00:29:08,779
Maybe.

352
00:29:11,382 --> 00:29:13,850
I didn't know what to say.

353
00:29:13,952 --> 00:29:18,412
How about, " Hi. Hello.
Been a long time. How are you?"

354
00:29:20,258 --> 00:29:22,658
[Cheering, Applauding]

355
00:29:22,761 --> 00:29:24,661
- Hi.
- Hello.

356
00:29:24,763 --> 00:29:27,357
- Been a long time. How are you?
- I'm good.

357
00:29:27,465 --> 00:29:29,365
How are you?

358
00:29:29,467 --> 00:29:32,163
Why don't we skip this boring stuff?

359
00:29:34,906 --> 00:29:38,137
You know, I didn't think,
uh, you'd still be here.

360
00:29:38,243 --> 00:29:40,143
Where else would I be?

361
00:29:40,245 --> 00:29:42,145
You had those lists, right?

362
00:29:42,247 --> 00:29:45,375
And you were gonna
go travel the world and-

363
00:29:46,718 --> 00:29:49,915
Things change.
We all need to grow up, right?

364
00:29:51,389 --> 00:29:53,357
So what do you do?

365
00:29:55,660 --> 00:29:58,220
Banking.
I'm in banking.

366
00:29:58,329 --> 00:30:01,025
In banking?
How'd you get into that?

367
00:30:01,132 --> 00:30:04,932
It's pretty easy, actually.
I just sort of landed in it.

368
00:30:05,036 --> 00:30:06,401
Didn't you flunk algebra?

369
00:30:06,504 --> 00:30:08,267
No.

370
00:30:08,373 --> 00:30:10,273
[Cheering, Whooping]

371
00:30:10,375 --> 00:30:13,344
- Fiona, I'm gonna take my break now.
- Yeah, sure. You bet.

372
00:30:13,444 --> 00:30:16,038
[Cheering, Shouting]

373
00:30:16,147 --> 00:30:19,674
- <i>##[Rock]</i>
- [Clears Throat] So, you're back.

374
00:30:19,784 --> 00:30:21,752
What now?
What's your plan?

375
00:30:22,987 --> 00:30:25,046
Maybe gonna do some traveling.

376
00:30:29,761 --> 00:30:33,458
I was thinking of maybe
checking out Rome, actually.

377
00:30:35,834 --> 00:30:38,735
You were thinking
of checking out Rome?

378
00:30:38,837 --> 00:30:41,806
You know that was my dream.
Don't try to rip me off. Okay?

379
00:30:44,709 --> 00:30:47,109
- So come with me.
- So come with you?

380
00:30:47,212 --> 00:30:50,409
- You're asking me to go to Rome?
- Mm-hmm.

381
00:30:50,515 --> 00:30:54,076
I mean, only if you want to
skip the boring parts.

382
00:30:55,887 --> 00:30:59,220
<i>##[Continues]</i>

383
00:31:01,392 --> 00:31:05,226
