386
00:31:32,523 --> 00:31:34,821
I got it.
I'll take it!

387
00:31:34,926 --> 00:31:36,621
- <i>Thank you.</i>
- As you like.

388
00:31:36,728 --> 00:31:38,195
Yeah, yeah.

389
00:31:39,864 --> 00:31:43,356
Can you believe just 10 hours ago
we were in Ann Arbor?

390
00:31:43,468 --> 00:31:45,402
Yeah.

391
00:31:45,570 --> 00:31:47,936
<i>[Man]</i>
<i>What does the C.I.A. want with this?</i>

392
00:31:48,039 --> 00:31:50,439
I'm afraid that's classified.

393
00:31:50,541 --> 00:31:52,441
Really?

394
00:31:52,543 --> 00:31:55,876
Well, then I'm afraid I'm gonna
have to see a federal warrant.

395
00:31:55,980 --> 00:31:58,448
'Cause I don't believe you are
who you say you are.

396
00:31:58,549 --> 00:32:00,210
Certainly.

397
00:32:00,318 --> 00:32:02,309
[Groans]

398
