Another cop.

399
00:32:21,472 --> 00:32:24,737
So, Mark, tell me
what happened at the bank.

400
00:32:24,842 --> 00:32:26,742
I told them already.

401
00:32:26,844 --> 00:32:29,904
You're just another suit.
You're never gonna believe me.

402
00:32:31,849 --> 00:32:34,818
It says here you were
beamed into the vault.

403
00:32:35,853 --> 00:32:37,821
[Sighs]

404
00:32:39,357 --> 00:32:43,191
You wanna laugh about it?
Go ahead. Have a laugh.

405
00:32:45,029 --> 00:32:47,395
You hear me laughing?

406
00:32:49,000 --> 00:32:50,900
The girl's name is Millie Harris.

407
00:32:51,002 --> 00:32:55,462
She boarded a plane to Rome 16 hours ago,
and she didn't go alone.

408
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:59,736
<i>[Bell Tolling]</i>

409
00:32:59,844 --> 00:33:01,812
[Speaking Italian]

410
00:33:09,988 --> 00:33:13,389
<i>So, what do you think?</i>

411
00:33:18,363 --> 00:33:21,958
I think there's something
you're not telling me.

412
00:33:24,369 --> 00:33:26,963
What do you mean?

413
00:33:28,139 --> 00:33:30,039
This room.

414
00:33:30,141 --> 00:33:32,109
First class.

415
00:33:34,512 --> 00:33:36,878
<i>Usually in my life,</i>
<i>when things seem too good to be true...</i>

416
00:33:36,981 --> 00:33:38,881
it's because they are.

417
00:33:38,983 --> 00:33:41,952
- I told you, I'm in banki-
- Banking?

418
00:33:44,889 --> 00:33:48,757
See, I <i>know</i>
that you flunked algebra.

419
00:33:48,860 --> 00:33:52,626
<i>If you don't wanna</i>
<i>tell me everything, that's fine.</i>

420
00:33:54,065 --> 00:33:56,556
But just don't lie to me.

421
00:33:57,835 --> 00:34:00,269
I'm not lying to you.

422
00:34:00,371 --> 00:34:02,339
No?

423
00:34:10,281 --> 00:34:12,249
Good.

424
00:34:20,158 --> 00:34:21,392
<i>##[Ballad]</i>

425
00:34:21,392 --> 00:34:22,859
<i>##[Ballad]</i>

426
00:34:28,766 --> 00:34:30,734
Can't... reach it.

